# Flex Design File Organization

Pattern: `{name}.{type}.design.pen`

Types: `tokens`, `patterns`, `component`, `template`, `flow`, `exploration`, `archive`

## Locations

- Tokens: `/design/system/tokens/`
- Components: `/design/system/components/`
- Flows: `/design/flows/{flowName}/{flowName}.flow.design.pen`
- Explorations: `/design/explorations/`

Code maps to `apps/mobile/src/shared/styles/StyleConstants.ts` and `apps/mobile/src/shared/components/`.

Never edit `.pen` files as text — use Pencil MCP tools.
